{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody is seeking the Ostium Magicae, a magical artefact capable of transporting entire armies to any location or dimension they desire. It\u2019s fallen into the hands of an acquaintance, and you\u2019ll need to track her down and help her sneak the artefact out of Nazi Germany and out of evil\u2019s hands. It\u2019s time to gear up and show Cthulhu\u2019s minions that it\u2019s not the Unknown they should fear -- it\u2019s you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quartermain and the Cult of Cthulhu is a fast-paced retro FPS game taking inspiration from Indiana Jones, Wolfenstein 3D, and tabletop RPGs. With a massive enemy roster, substantial arsenal, and retro soundtrack, Quartermain is a bite-sized boomer shooter primed to offer much bang for your (three) buck(s).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets Galore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unspeakable Monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Train Level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch Nazis in the Face!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3379770/dbec788ac09556ce56c53e165cb84b94d92dadaa.jpg"},{"name":"E1M1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3379770/ea903ab0e2aca95c578f9b8367c76ce2fb0b60dc.jpg"},{"name":"Quarter Muncher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3379770/59df945e520a125924ac8a7d7caba7377cefaf98.jpg"},{"name":"Smells Like Bacon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3379770/1aa878888d9435fdeb4a2fe87cb19c900bdc4cec.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st